ME env (${root}) overrides configured homeDir (${configRoot}).`);\n125\t    }\n126\t  } else if (configRoot) {\n127\t    root = path.resolve(configRoot);\n128\t    source = \"config\";\n129\t  } else {\n130\t    root = path.join(userDataPath, DEFAULT_HOME_DIRNAME);\n131\t    source = \"default\";\n132\t  }\n133\t\n134\t  // 2. Benny home: env override > legacy config key > legacy per-user default\n135\t  //    (pre-unification installs) > derived.\n136\t  let bennyHome;\n137\t  let bennyHomeSource;\n138\t  const envBenny = trimmed(env.BENNY_HOME);\n139\t  const legacyConfigBenny = trimmed(config.bennyHome);\n140\t  const legacyDefaultBenny = path.join(userDataPath, LEGACY_BENNY_DIRNAME);\n141\t  if (envBenny) {\n142\t    bennyHome = path.resolve(envBenny);\n143\t    bennyHomeSource = \"env-override\";\n144\t  } else if (legacyConfigBenny) {\n145\t    bennyHome = path.resolve(legacyConfigBenny);\n146\t    bennyHomeSource = \"legacy-config\";\n147\t    warnings.push(\n148\t      `Benny home comes from the legacy config key \"bennyHome\" (${bennyHome}); ` +\n149\t        `adopt the unified home to derive it from ${root}.`\n150\t    );\n151\t  } else if (source === \"default\" && dirExists(legacyDefaultBenny)) {\n152\t    bennyHome = legacyDefaultBenny;\n153\t    bennyHomeSource = \"legacy-default\";\n154\t    warnings.push(\n155\t      `Benny home uses the pre-unification default (${bennyHome}); ` +\n156\t        `adopt the unified home to move it under ${root}.`\n157\t    );\n158\t  } else {\n159\t    bennyHome = path.join(root, BENNY_SUBDIR);\n160\t    bennyHomeSource = \"derived\";\n161\t  }\n162\t  if (bennyHomeSource === \"env-override\" && !isInside(bennyHome, root)) {\n163\t    warnings.push(\n164\t      `BENNY_HOME env override (${bennyHome}) points outside the declared home (${root}).`\n165\t    );\n166\t  }\n167\t\n168\t  // 3. Customware: env override > legacy per-user default > derived.\n169\t  let customwarePath;\n170\t  let customwareSource;\n171\t  const